 YesOrNoWithNestedQuestion;myGuiParms;msg;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button together with a nested message in error style
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 msg←'Are you really sure about this?' '' 'This does not look right.'
 msg,←'In fact I think it is total rubbish.' 'I have never seen something similarly stupid.'
 msg,←'' 'I suggest you reconsider your decision.'
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.addToCaption←'My caption'
 parms.style←##.GUI.Enums.DialogStyles.Error
 {}parms myGuiParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo msg
